│ Is there a causal relationship?", "abstract": "There is mounting evidence in support of a significant role for       │
│ influenza infection in the development of atherosclerosis and the triggering of its complications. Here we review    │
│ the biologic basis of this relationship, with special emphasis on the pro-inflammatory and pro-thrombotic effects of │
