│ suspected cases, we obtained nasal and throat swabs to identify influenza RNA with real-time PCR. Efficacy analyses  │
│ were done per protocol. This trial is registered with ClinicalTrials.gov, number NCT00753272. FINDINGS We enrolled   │
│ 43 802 participants, of whom 21 893 were assigned to and received the AS03-adjuvanted TIV and 21 802 the             │
│ non-adjuvanted TIV in year 1. In the year 1 efficacy cohort, fewer participants given AS03-adjuvanted than           │
