│ influenza than does a non-adjuvanted TIV. Future influenza vaccine studies in elderly people should be based on      │
│ subtype or lineage-specific endpoints. FUNDING GlaxoSmithKline Biologicals SA."}, {"study_index": 25, "title":       │
│ "Comparison of the safety and immunogenicity of concomitant and sequential administration of an adult formulation    │
│ tetanus and diphtheria toxoids adsorbed combined with acellular pertussis (Tdap) vaccine and trivalent inactivated   │
│ influenza vaccine in adults", "abstract": "The annual contact for influenza vaccination provides an opportunity to   │
