cardiovascular events. The greatest treatment effect was seen among the highest-risk patients with more active coronary 
disease. A large, adequately powered, multicenter trial is warranted to address these findings and assess individual    
cardiovascular end points."},                                                                                           
        {"study_index": 48, "title": "Influenza as a trigger for acute myocardial infarction or death from              
